{
  "CROWD Boo!!!": "觀眾：噓——！！！",
  "The town went wild over his triumph against Red Dragon, raising him to the status of Champion and making him their ruler in her stead. He styled yourself a king, and as king he had but a few simple decrees: Combat in the arena must continue. A new crop of fighters had to be found to replace those he plowed through on your way to victory - There was no fun to be found watching his defeated foes struggle against each other in the dirt. And last, those who were replaced were to live in his hall at his mercy, serving his every whim as your personal harem. And if he saw it fit that they must fight amongst themselves for your favor as the Champion’s Whore, then so be it. Only this time they would not fight with fists, or clubs, or fire, but with tongues and fingers and dripping holes across the arena of your body.": "小鎮為他擊敗赤龍而瘋狂，擁戴他為新任冠軍，讓他接替她成為統治者。他自封為王，而這位國王只頒下幾道簡單的命令：競技場的比賽要照常舉行；先前被他一路打敗的選手得換成新人，畢竟看手下敗將在泥地裡互毆，實在沒什麼意思。最後，那些退下來的選手必須住進王宮，任他差遣，成為他的後宮。要是她們得爭奪『冠軍寵姬』的地位，那就爭吧；只是這次不再用拳頭、棍棒或烈火，而是在他的床上爭個高下。",
  " Hail to the king, baby!": "向國王致敬，寶貝！",
  "Months later, he awakened with his face full of fluffy rat flesh as a swarm of younglings crawled across your body. He groaned and shook his head. How did it come to this, again? He just couldn't keep it in your pants, could he?! She went down on him like no other, draining him dry. She kept him sexually satiated and nearly unconscious for days, weeks, months maybe. Probably. Before he knew it, he had sired a brood of little ratlings, all calling him \"daddy\". Now that the children were here, she had no need for your seed. He spent his days taking care of his children while Rat became the cheesewinner for the family, leaving the home in his hands and his libido thoroughly unsatisfied.": "幾個月後，他醒來時，一群毛茸茸的鼠寶寶正爬得他滿臉滿身。他呻吟一聲，搖了搖頭：事情怎麼又變成這樣了？他當初就是管不住自己，對吧？鼠鼠讓他一次次精疲力盡，幾天、幾週，或許幾個月都沒能好好清醒。等他回過神，已經有了一窩喊他『爸爸』的鼠寶寶。孩子生下來後，鼠鼠不再需要他幫忙生育。他每天在家照顧孩子，鼠鼠則出去賺錢養家——或者說，賺起司養家。家務全歸他管，可他的需求卻完全沒人理會。",
  "You may have bested Orc in the arena, but marriage proves to be a far more dangerous battlefield. Your spouse quickly takes charge of the relationship, asserting her dominance and making every decision for the household as you are left to handle the chores entirely on your own. As time passes, you are trained to like it, responding to your wife’s every beck and call in an instant, fulfilling her whims while yours go unheeded. What little sex life you have is dedicated entirely to getting her off - if you are do a good job you might get permission to masturbate once a month, and you wouldn’t have it any other way. You don’t want to make her angry, after all. She might take that for a challenge.": "你在競技場打贏了半獸人，婚姻卻是更凶險的戰場。妻子很快便掌握了這段關係，家裡大小事全由她決定，家務則全部交給你。日子久了，你甚至被調教得樂在其中；她一聲呼喚，你就立刻趕到，她的願望總能實現，你自己的卻無人理會。少得可憐的親密時光，也全用來滿足她。要是表現得夠好，說不定每個月還能得到一次自行解決的許可——而你居然覺得這樣也不錯。畢竟你不想惹她生氣；她可能會把那當成挑戰。",
  "Gnoll showed about as much commitment to their marriage itself as she did to the proposal, which is to say: Not much. Oh, sure, the nightly pegging sessions were fun at first, and he even got the chance to put a baby or two in her. But between the near-constant fighting (that girl sure loves to argue) and Gnoll spending more and more of her time away from home, often not coming back at night if at all,  their relationship rapidly sours into screaming children, a dead bedroom, and more nights alone than together with his wife. Oh well, it was fun while it lasted. At least the two of them still bickered like in old times.": "豺狼人對婚姻的投入，跟她當初求婚時差不多：幾乎沒有。起初，每晚那些刺激的花樣確實有趣，他們甚至還生了一兩個孩子。可兩人幾乎天天吵架——她就是愛鬥嘴——而豺狼人待在家的時間愈來愈少，常常連晚上都不回來。這段關係很快只剩哭鬧的孩子、冷清的臥房，以及他獨自度過的漫漫長夜。唉，至少曾經快樂過；而且兩人到現在吵起嘴來，倒還跟以前一樣。",
  "The ceremony between the two of them was beautiful, minus all the times Ettin Right punched him during the vows. He and Ettin Left made a wonderful couple, spending their days out amongst nature and their nights in blissful union, much to her other head’s chagrin. Everything seemed perfect, until he began to notice Left greeting him a bit less enthusiastically in the morning, paying less attention to him in bed... Eventually she confessed: The girlish spark she felt for him in the arena was only a fleeting feeling - In fact, she didn’t much enjoy domestic life at all. Not wanting to bear the shame of divorce, she handed over responsibility of him to her Right head, who gleefully enacted her revenge for fucking her body the past several months by sending him to the doghouse - Literally. When he was lucky, you got to come inside, but most of his days were spent out in the yard, listening to the two sisters bicker and argue day after day about this chore and that before inevitably deciding to simply have him handle it. At least the walkies were a nice reminder of better days.": "兩人的婚禮十分美好——只要不算上宣誓時右邊那顆頭揍他的次數。他與左邊那顆頭是對好伴侶，白天一同親近大自然，夜裡則甜蜜相依，惹得另一顆頭很不高興。一切原本都很完美，直到他發現左邊那顆頭早上迎接他時不再那麼熱情，夜裡也逐漸心不在焉。最後她坦白：競技場裡那份少女情懷只是一時衝動，她其實根本不喜歡家庭生活。她又不願承受離婚的難堪，便把照顧他的責任交給右邊那顆頭。右邊立刻樂得報復他，因為這幾個月他一直和她們共用的身體親熱——她真的把他趕進了狗屋。運氣好時，他還能進屋待一會兒；大多數日子卻只能待在院子，聽兩姊妹為家務吵個不停，最後再把活兒全推給他。至少出去散步時，還能想起從前的好日子。",
  "Gargoyle was a perfect companion, a sweet little wife who truly enjoyed cooking and cleaning, and supported him in every endeavor, and offered her body to you with a smile every night. He couldn’t have been happier in marriage. He loved her so much even, that when she politely posed the question of adding more people to your lovemaking - Just to see what it is like! - You acquiesce, happy to make her happy. The situation quickly got out of hand, however, as Gargoyle found her awakening in the arms of several men in town: Nothing got her off more than reducing him, Champion of the Arena, to a cuckold. His marriage may have seemed perfect on the outside, but the only person touching his cock these days was him. At least he got to watch.": "石像鬼曾是完美伴侶：這位甜美的小妻子真心喜歡煮飯、打掃，支持他做的每件事，也總笑著陪他度過夜晚。他對婚姻滿意極了，愛她愛到連她客氣地提議讓別人加入兩人的親密時光——『只是想知道是什麼感覺嘛！』——也欣然答應，只盼她開心。可事情很快失控。石像鬼在鎮上好幾個男人的懷裡發現新樂趣：她最興奮的，就是讓競技場冠軍眼睜睜看著自己被戴綠帽。這樁婚姻表面仍然完美，如今肯碰他的卻只剩他自己。至少他還能在旁邊看。",
  "Six months later and she had taken his home, his money, all of his awards, weapons, and armor, not to mention a sample of his handwriting, hair, and a healthy amount of his blood. Worst of all, she never even bothered to give him a quickie for his trouble, let alone leave him with any cash to purchase a “helping hand”. Hey, at least he still had his helmet and a killer bachelor box to live in. Who cares that it rained four days out of seven and the road outside is paved in horse shit? Oh, wait. He did.": "六個月後，她拿走了他的房子、錢、所有獎盃、武器和盔甲，還採集了他的筆跡、頭髮與不少血液樣本。最糟的是，她連一點親熱都不肯給，更沒留錢讓他找別人幫忙。好吧，至少他還有頭盔，以及一個很有單身風格的紙箱可以住。誰在乎一週七天有四天下雨，門外的路還鋪滿馬糞？噢，等等。他在乎。",
  "His new wife may have been a bit quirky, but boy did she love to fuck his brains out. Any time of the day, always riding him, sucking him, tugging him, every position under the sun as she fills up her notebooks with equations and diagrams. Content to serve as her sexual guinea pig, he never paid that aspect of her work too much mind. Perhaps he should have, for the day came when she strapped him down to her laboratory table not to bounce on his lap as he had hoped, but to spread out a selection of pointy instruments, odd-colored vials, and sparking electrodes. It turned out, she explained, that the sexual portion of her research was fulfilled, but there was still more data on him and his “magic” to gather. Much, much more.": "新婚妻子或許有點古怪，卻熱衷得不得了。無論什麼時候，她都會拉著他嘗試各種姿勢，還不忘在筆記本裡寫滿算式與圖表。他甘心當她的親密實驗對象，從沒多想她究竟在研究什麼。或許他早該多想：有一天，她把他綁在實驗桌上，擺出的不是他期待的溫存，而是一排尖銳器具、顏色古怪的小瓶子和冒著電火花的電極。她解釋說，關於那方面的研究已經完成；但他的『魔法』還有更多資料值得蒐集。多得多。",
  "Being a human test subject to a drug-addled warrior woman had its ups and downs. On one hand, she was able to brew up some mojo that doubled the size of his member and flooded his body with intense sensations beyond any he had even imagined before. On the other hand, he passed out almost immediately from the massive rush of blood from brain to peen, and upon awakening he found his cock had shriveled up like an empty balloon left out in the sun. Nothing Troll could brew up was able to restore his potency, and her ability to grant him a youthful appearance, long-lasting life, and heightened mental acuity fails to lift his spirits just as they fail to lift his sad, flaccid cock.": "成為這位嗜藥戰士的人體實驗對象，日子可說有好有壞。一方面，巨魔調製的藥能讓他的那根變大一倍，還帶來前所未有的強烈快感；另一方面，血液一下全衝到下半身，讓他幾乎立刻昏了過去。醒來後，他發現那根萎縮得像被太陽曬乾的空氣球。巨魔再怎麼調藥也恢復不了他的雄風；即使她能讓他重拾青春容貌、延年益壽、頭腦更靈光，也無法讓他或那根垂頭喪氣的東西重新振作。",
